    "body": "Ah, I was thinking this might not be web compatible, but this is a twist on the agreement reached at https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/1826#issuecomment-457206756. We would still reuse a named browsing context if it exists, but if we create something new, we would not use the name. I like it. Please also test this with `noreferrer` as we don't want that to diverge from `noopener`.\r\n\r\n(You'll also need to join the googlers organization or make your membership thereof public.)",
